### What was documented
1. Quick-start with v2 gensuper.yaml and generated configs
2. Control API v2 routes: POST register/report, GET snapshot/events
3. HMAC signing scheme (X-EG-NodeID/Timestamp/Nonce/Signature headers)
4. Security boundary: ControlPSKey is per-Edge SECRET, json:"-" tag
5. TLS via reverse proxy required for production
6. SSE with Last-Event-ID + polling fallback + ETag/304
7. STUN same-socket limitation
8. No relay/TURN: failed hole-punch = unreachable
9. v1 config rejection with migration pointer
10. Complete v2 SuperNode and EdgeNode config parameter tables

